; Tincture demo: a sunset over the sea, in three layers (Tincture --script demo/sunset.tsc)
NEW 640 512
; sky: bands of colour, then a soft airbrushed glow
COLOR 30 24 80
BGCOLOR 250 170 90
GRADIENT 0 0 0 320
LAYER ADD Sun
COLOR 255 220 90
CIRCLE 320 300 70 FILL
COLOR 255 240 170
CIRCLE 320 300 50 FILL
LAYER ADD Sea
COLOR 20 40 90
BOX 0 320 640 192
COLOR 60 90 160
BRUSH 3
LINE 220 340 420 340
LINE 250 360 390 360
LINE 280 382 360 382
LINE 300 404 340 404
COLOR 255 200 110
LINE 240 336 400 336
LINE 270 356 370 356
; a boat
COLOR 10 10 20
BRUSH 1
BOX 120 300 50 10
LINE 145 300 145 250
COLOR 240 240 230
ELLIPSE 158 278 12 22 FILL
; birds
COLOR 30 20 40
BRUSH 2
DRAW 480 120 490 112 500 120
DRAW 505 100 513 94 521 100
DRAW 530 130 537 124 544 130
LAYER SELECT 1
COLOR 255 190 120
SPRAY 320 280 90 1500
SPRAY 300 300 90 1500
LAYER SELECT 3
TEXT 16 488 "Tincture 1.0 - painted by an ARexx-style script" 1
MAGNIFIER ON 150 280
